OL,3,GNEWSASchools need security upgrades,
OL,4,Aminister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of schools across Jersey
OL,7,Frequire upgrades to fencing, CCTV,
OL,8,Faccess controls and safeguarding
OL,9,Finfrastructure, according to the
OL,10,Feducation minister.
OL,12,FDeputy Catherine Curtis said investment
OL,13,Fwas needed to improve security and
OL,14,Ftemperature management across the
OL,15,Fschool estate - but did not specify
OL,16,Fwhich schools.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
