OL,3,GNEWSASchools need security upgrades,
OL,4,Aminister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurtis made the case in a letter to
OL,7,FDeputy Victoria Li, chair of the
OL,8,FChildren, Education and Home Affairs
OL,9,FScrutiny Panel, which has been
OL,10,Fexamining the proposed 2027-2030
OL,11,Fbudget.
OL,13,FCurtis said there was an allocation of
OL,14,F#2.5m in 2027 and #1.974m in 2028 for
OL,15,Fupgrades, but further investment would
OL,16,Fbe required.
